SUMMARY:ELLIOT PECK GRAHAME LESH ~ Sunset Series
DESCRIPTION:OUTDOOR SUNSET SERIES with ELLIOT PECK & GRAHAME LESH\nElliot Peck – As one of the most sought-after vocalists on the West Coast\, Elliott Peck has made a name for herself lending harmonies to everyone from Phil Lesh and Bob Weir to Jackie Greene and Lukas Nelson.\nGrahame Lesh – Based in the musical hotbed of Marin County\, California\, Grahame Lesh is a guitar player and singer-songwriter for Midnight North\, Phil Lesh & Friends\, & the Terrapin Family Band.
