SUMMARY:CALTUCKY ~ Outdoor Sunset Series
DESCRIPTION:OUTDOOR SUNSET SERIES with CALTUCKY\nCaltucky is a progressive bluegrass band from Northern California blending tradition\, improvisation\, and grit. With fiery banjo\, soulful fiddle\, and fearless harmonies\, their sound sits somewhere between the mountains and the cosmos — high-energy\, heartfelt\, and impossible to stand still to.
